:true}},"body":"### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nBefore 3.1.0.Final this code was working to get the Quarkus Version.\r\n\r\n```java\r\n\"Quarkus: \" + \r\nStringUtils.defaultIfEmpty(\r\n            io.quarkus.bootstrap.runner.QuarkusEntryPoint.class.getPackage().getImplementationVersion(), \"???\");\r\n```\r\n\r\nNow however `getImplementationVersion` is returning NULL because it looks like Quarkus JARS have an almost empty MANIFEST.MF.\r\n\r\n**3.0.3.Final MANIFEST.MF**\r\n\r\n```\r\nManifest-Version: 1.0\r\nCreated-By: Maven Archiver 3.4.0\r\nBuild-Jdk-Spec: 11\r\nSpecification-Title: ArC - Runtime\r\nSpecification-Version: 3.0\r\nSpecification-Vendor: JBoss by Red Hat\r\nImplementation-Title: ArC - Runtime\r\nImplementation-Version: 3.0.3.Final\r\nImplementation-Vendor: JBoss by Red Hat\r\nImplementation-URL: https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus\r\nJava-Vendor: Eclipse Adoptium\r\nJava-Version: 11.0.17\r\nOs-Arch: amd64\r\nOs-Name: Linux\r\nOs-Version: 5.15.12-200.fc35.x86_64\r\nScm-Connection: scm:git:git@github.com:quarkusio/quarkus.git\r\nScm-Revision: 37b8b79e07ef615b5ba8b25505c8054834cc05a4\r\nScm-Url: https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus\r\n```\r\n\r\n**3.1.0.Final MANIFEST.MF**\r\n\r\n```\r\nManifest-Version: 1.0\r\nCreated-By: Maven JAR Plugin 3.3.0\r\nBuild-Jdk-Spec: 11\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### How to Reproduce?\r\n\r\nJust look inside any JAR from Quarkus\r\n\r\n### Output of `uname -a` or `ver`\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Output of `java -version`\r\n\r\nOpenJDK Runtime Environment Temurin-17.0.6+10 (build 17.0.6+10)\r\n\r\n### GraalVM version (if different from Java)\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Quarkus version or git rev\r\n\r\n3.1.0.Final\r\n\r\n### Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`)\r\n\r\nApache Maven 3.9.1 (2e178502fcdbffc201671fb2537d0cb4b4cc58f8)\r\n\r\n### Additional information\r\n\r\n_No response_","reactions":{"url":